## Source and runtime / Исходники и библиотеки

The [release source tree](@pd_source_tree@) contains the CMake presets, the C ABI, and the packaging scripts. [vcpkg.json](vcpkg.json) pins the dependency recipes; their sources and patches are linked in the [notices](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md). Qt DLLs are dynamically replaceable. Do not treat the host license as the license of the Microsoft runtime or the Inno Setup engine. In a Windows package, `RUNTIME_INVENTORY.md` lists the actual runtime files, origins and SHA-256 digests; `LICENSES/ports/` contains the matching notices and SPDX records.

[Исходники этого выпуска](@pd_source_tree@), [лицензия хоста](LICENSE), [MIT для SDK и примеров](LICENSES/MIT.txt), [условия поставки](docs/LICENSING.md). Библиотеки Qt можно заменить совместимой сборкой. Нативный движок DWG, драйверы и шрифты не входят в комплект.
